FDWM's own: each key and mouse button, and each line of TAGKEYS, ends with
its description, as a comment "/* group: what it does */" (the groups are
windows, tags, layouts, apps and system), which keys.awk in the repo reads
for ~/.config/fdwm/keys, the list fdwm-keys shows. Alt+/ (keyscmd) opens
it. Two lines lose stray whitespace. The man page says so.

